.git
.gitignore
.github
.claude
.idea

# npm ci rebuilds this in the image. Copying the host's tree over a freshly installed one
# also copies binaries built for the host platform — a build that succeeds and an image
# that crashes.
node_modules
dist
coverage
.vite

*.log

# The EMS repo already paid for this lesson: COPY . . bakes whatever is in the build
# context into a layer, and .gitignore has no bearing on the build context.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
